{"items":[{"id":"528008772","root":"528008772","user":{"id":"419474","name":"棉花街","avatar":"ee2737a83a4978ca0704a818"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1807/]没事，人都在，不忙了应该能够看到他们发动态的。猴山的猴子就算是走了，很多也会回来发动态当UP的，静静等待就是了。你要是一个人觉得等得寂寞，那么大家一起等，我们这里还有鱼","time":1636164886211,"floor":9,"likes":27,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":true},{"id":"528003683","root":"528003683","user":{"id":"11156360","name":"从深渊向外招手de寄摆人","avatar":"9a94552a8090cc0a93147baa"},"text":"本山换位置了啊不管你们了吗","time":1636164172562,"floor":2,"likes":24,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":11,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"528006131","root":"528003683","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"嗯呐，现在是小武负责我这边了","time":1636164469725,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"528006529","root":"528003683","user":{"id":"11156360","name":"从深渊向外招手de寄摆人","avatar":"9a94552a8090cc0a93147baa"},"text":"555我的山宝，负责的up都换了，自己还没有找到对她负责的好男孩","time":1636164522377,"floor":1,"likes":8,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"1001Project","replyToUserId":"179922","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"528010556","root":"528003683","user":{"id":"9130318","name":"我不是奶茶T","avatar":"941b6d350a808b4199da0b7f"},"text":"[img=图片]https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/9130318_6a62347b7cce42cf90cd43c836e6fc35.jpeg[/img]","time":1636165197866,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"从深渊向外招手de寄摆人","replyToUserId":"11156360","parentCommentId":null,"images":["8267391e1e80f5c09d3593f3"],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"528114701","root":"528114701","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[color=#4f81bd]昨天深夜跟几个DD聊起来，大家都是无限唏嘘，有点落寞的心情，然后蒂老板突然跳出来把我们都骂了一通。\n其实心情平复后回过头来想想，也确实没必要。只是认识陪伴了很久的熟人正常工作调动罢了，朵朵去了水母（其实之前的动态也能感觉到她重心慢慢放在水母那边了），本山去了快手运营岗，都是因为工作出色去了更重要的岗位，独当一面了，是好事来的。应该恭喜祝福他们（会更忙了吧，哼哼），而且都还在一个系统里，远远谈不到“离开”什么的。\n再回过头来想想，自己曾经无比信赖的朋友有了更好更重要的发展舞台，自己也将迎来新的对接的猴子，认识新的朋友共同成长，大家都在不断进步，这是好事情啊！\n往回看就总是留恋不舍，往前看，就是新的期待和梦想，应该是开心的事情。阿水肯定也会越来越好的，大家都加油吧[emot=acfun,1859/][/color]","time":1636177769127,"floor":34,"likes":13,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":10,"hot":true,"replyPreview":[{"id":"528123954","root":"528114701","user":{"id":"248209","name":"伊001人不在.","avatar":"34d09272dbf186e288ccb225"},"text":"换了个工作岗位而已，还认识，人还在。就好了","time":1636178900580,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"528174731","root":"528114701","user":{"id":"3027702","name":"qyqx是ACFUN最勤劳的UP","avatar":"4d6cd901d9c26300a4ec1a6a"},"text":"这么说王德发是不是也去了更重要的岗位[emot=acfun,1653/]","time":1636184435316,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"528185488","root":"528114701","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"55cb0c0a2d2740d47c6055f0"},"text":"虽然已经不会因为离别要死要活了，叠加起来未免还是有些落寞[emot=acfun,2428/]","time":1636185659106,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":true,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}]},{"id":"528265035","root":"528265035","user":{"id":"43312390","name":"你是我的美玉无瑕疵","avatar":"3127564d722687e3415d713b"},"text":"[emot=acfun,1817/][emot=acfun,1817/][emot=acfun,1817/]","time":1636194703036,"floor":36,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"528115977","root":"528115977","user":{"id":"123824","name":"蓝字","avatar":"98c51f1fc4d31ab229e2610d"},"text":"[img=图片]https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/123824_fa354061f89f4e41be8c7bab13f14e18.jpeg[/img]","time":1636177923824,"floor":35,"likes":2,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":